    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d24">

                <pb facs="0202" n="30" xml:id="pg30"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/424</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-01-23T18:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 23, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received January 24, 8.05
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>803. Minister for Foreign Affairs expresses interest in knowing what particular
                    plan President [proposes] for peace preservation league. Swiss Minister declares
                    address “finest noblest diplomatic document read by him during long diplomatic
                    life.”</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
